              <div
                class="panel-body p-0"
              >
                <div
                  class="p-4"
                >
                  <p
                    class="text-4 text-secondary"
                  >
                    Properties let you consolidate data from individuals, accounts, campaigns, sites, and commerce channels in one place. An individual's data is available in every property they are assigned to.
                  </p>
                  <div
                    class="mb-4"
                  >
                    <span
                      class="text-3 text-secondary font-weight-semi-bold"
                    >
                      DATA AVAILABILITY
